    "created_at": "2026-09-03T15:44:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-03T15:44:46Z",
    "body": "Oh actually light DOM children aren't actually scope-owned by the trigger, only the shadow root is. So the spec currently requires that the children of the trigger are visited after the popover. So I think it makes sense to have the same behaviour for shadow roots as well.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
